OL,3,AGavin and Stacey stars join Ruth Jones
OL,4,Afor 60th birthday party at social club
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin and Stacey's Ruth Jones has
OL,7,Fcelebrated her 60th birthday at a
OL,8,Fsocial club with co-stars including
OL,9,FJames Corden and Rob Brydon.
OL,11,FThe party took place at the Porthcawl
OL,12,Fand Kenfig Hill RAFA (Royal Air Force
OL,13,FAssociation) Club on Saturday where her
OL,14,Fparents were members for several years.
OL,16,FCorden, who co-wrote the series and
OL,17,Fplayed Smithy - the love interest of
OL,18,FJones' Nessa - helped behind the bar
OL,19,Fpouring beers, while Jones reconnected
OL,20,Fwith Brydon to sing country classic
OL,21,FIslands in the Stream on stage.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
