OL,3,AGavin and Stacey stars join Ruth Jones
OL,4,Afor 60th birthday party at social club
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Prescott, the club's steward,
OL,7,Fdescribed the evening as "overwhelming
OL,8,Fand unbelievable", thanking Jones for
OL,9,Fchoosing the club to host the event.
